{"seq":3,"slug":"satellite-imagery-deforestation-verification","title":"卫星影像比对与毁林变化监测数据管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/parcel-geolocation-traceability-data/satellite-imagery-deforestation-verification","wordCount":3092,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"卫星影像比对与毁林变化监测数据管线\">卫星影像比对与毁林变化监测数据管线</h1><p>把地块多边形丢进一张卫星底图，然后&quot;看一眼&quot;有没有变秃，在 EUDR 语境下不构成证据。法规要求的是一个<strong>时间可复现、几何可追溯、来源可核验</strong>的比对过程：对每个地块说明它在 2020 年 12 月 31 日基准时点的森林状态，以及此后至采伐时点之间是否发生森林转化。本文承接<a href=\"parcel-geolocation-data-model\">地块地理定位数据模型</a>产出的 GeoJSON 几何，把它接入一整条影像比对管线——从影像源选型、变化检测算子，到与官方底图和告警层的交叉核验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-什么叫-可复现的毁林比对\">核心概念：什么叫&quot;可复现的毁林比对&quot;</h2><p>EUDR 的实体义务只有一句话：商品不得来自&quot;recently deforested land&quot;，即 2020 年 12 月 31 日之后被转化为非森林用途的土地（条例 (EU) 2023/1115 第 3 条与第 2 条第 3 款给出的基准时点）。落到管线里就是三段式判定：<strong>基准期影像 → 变化检测 → 面积归属</strong>，三个环节都必须能被独立复算，否则一旦被主管机关抽查，你无法解释某块多边形为何被判为&quot;无风险&quot;。</p>\n<p>这条管线要与几个易混概念切开：它<strong>不是</strong>森林碳汇计量（MRV/VERRA 体系），也<strong>不是</strong>一般性的森林覆盖制图（JRC 全球森林覆盖图这类宏观产品），而是<strong>地块级、基准时点锚定</strong>的判定。欧盟森林观测台（EU Forest Observatory，简称 EUFO）2024 年上线后提供统一参考图层，官方意图是让企业自建平台与监管方用同一套底图说话，减少口径分歧（来源：欧盟委员会 EUDR 官方页面，2026 年更新）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[地块多边形 GeoJSON] --&gt; B[基准时点影像 2020-12-31]&#10;  A --&gt; F[采伐后影像&lt;br/&gt;生产时间区间]&#10;  B --&gt; C{影像源}&#10;  F --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|光学| D[Sentinel-2 L2A 10m]&#10;  C --&gt;|雷达| E[Sentinel-1 C 波段 SAR]&#10;  D --&gt; G[NDVI/NBR 时序 或 CCDC]&#10;  E --&gt; H[后向散射突变 RADD 类]&#10;  G --&gt; I[变化像元 → 面积归属]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{变化落在&lt;br/&gt;地块环内?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[标记风险 → 深度尽调]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[交叉核验 EUFO / JRC]&#10;  L --&gt; M[生成可复现证据包]\">flowchart TD\n  A[地块多边形 GeoJSON] --&gt; B[基准时点影像 2020-12-31]\n  A --&gt; F[采伐后影像&lt;br/&gt;生产时间区间]\n  B --&gt; C{影像源}\n  F --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|光学| D[Sentinel-2 L2A 10m]\n  C --&gt;|雷达| E[Sentinel-1 C 波段 SAR]\n  D --&gt; G[NDVI/NBR 时序 或 CCDC]\n  E --&gt; H[后向散射突变 RADD 类]\n  G --&gt; I[变化像元 → 面积归属]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{变化落在&lt;br/&gt;地块环内?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[标记风险 → 深度尽调]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[交叉核验 EUFO / JRC]\n  L --&gt; M[生成可复现证据包]</pre><p>上面的设计要点是：<strong>哨兵（Sentinel）光学与雷达必须并行</strong>，单一数据源在热带产区会失效（见下节）；判定结果不是二值的&quot;是/否&quot;，而是带坐标、带日期、带算法版本号的<strong>变化记录</strong>，才构成证据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定环节</th>\n<th>需要的元数据</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基准时点影像</td>\n<td>场景 ID、采集日期、云量、轨道号</td>\n<td>无法证明基准时是森林</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化检测</td>\n<td>算法版本、阈值、波段组合</td>\n<td>结果不可复算，抽查即崩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积归属</td>\n<td>地块几何版本 + 相交面积</td>\n<td>变化可能落在邻地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉核验</td>\n<td>官方图层版本与访问日期</td>\n<td>与监管口径不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"影像源选型-光学与雷达的互补\">影像源选型：光学与雷达的互补</h2><p>Sentinel-2 是 EUDR 比对的主力光学数据源，由 ESA 运营、属哥白尼计划的免费开放数据，双星（S2A 2015 年 6 月、S2B 2017 年 3 月、S2C 2024 年 9 月补网）在轨协同，提供 <strong>10 米分辨率</strong>、<strong>290 公里幅宽</strong>、<strong>约 5 天重访</strong>的多光谱影像（来源：<a href=\"https://www.esa.int/Applications/Observing_the_Earth/Copernicus/Sentinel-2\">ESA Sentinel-2 任务页</a>）。10 米像元是整条管线的隐含分辨率下限，会在面积判定中反复咬人。近红外（NIR，约 842 nm）与短波红外（SWIR，约 1610/2190 nm）是植被健康度的核心信号，也是 NDVI、NBR 等指数的原料；生产管线一般直接消费 L2A 级产品。</p>\n<p>光学数据的致命伤是<strong>云</strong>。东南亚棕榈、西非可可等关键产区常年云量高企，地块在采伐后的窗口里可能连续数月没有可用影像，NDVI 时序出现&quot;缺口&quot;，线性插值反而会把真实变化平滑掉。</p>\n<p>Sentinel-1 补上了这个缺口。它是 C 波段合成孔径雷达（SAR），同为 10 米级分辨率，<strong>全天候、昼夜成像</strong>。雷达后向散射对地表结构（树冠、土壤裸露度）敏感，森林被砍伐并转为裸地时后向散射系数显著突变——这正是 RADD（Radar for Detecting Deforestation）告警算法的物理基础，由瓦赫宁根大学与 Global Forest Watch 团队合作开发，面向热带提供近实时砍伐告警。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Sentinel-2 光学</th>\n<th>Sentinel-1 雷达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分辨率</td>\n<td>10 / 20 / 60 m 分级</td>\n<td>约 10 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重访</td>\n<td>约 5 天（双星）</td>\n<td>约 6–12 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受云影响</td>\n<td>严重，热带可用率低</td>\n<td>无影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构敏感度</td>\n<td>间接（光谱变化）</td>\n<td>直接（后向散射突变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要用途</td>\n<td>精细变化边界</td>\n<td>兜底告警、云区补充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程结论很直接：<strong>Sentinel-1 当兜底告警层，Sentinel-2 当边界确认层</strong>——SAR 先粗告警，光学再确认变化类型与精确边界。算法与库版本、场景 ID 全部入库，任何判定都能被第三方重放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变化检测算子-从-ndvi-时序到-ccdc\">变化检测算子：从 NDVI 时序到 CCDC</h2><p>最朴素的做法是双时相比对：取基准期一景、采伐后一景，计算归一化差异植被指数（NDVI）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NDVI} = \\frac{\\rho_{\\mathrm{NIR}} - \\rho_{\\mathrm{red}}}{\\rho_{\\mathrm{NIR}} + \\rho_{\\mathrm{red}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NDVI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">NIR</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">red</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">NIR</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">red</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>健康森林的 NDVI 通常落在 0.7–0.9，砍伐后转为裸地骤降到 0.2–0.3，可设阈值如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\mathrm{NDVI} &lt; -0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NDVI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 判为植被显著损失。但双时相法有两个坑：云污染单景会伪造假阳性；季节性落叶、休耕、收割也带来大幅波动，尤其在可可、咖啡这类农林间作体系里。</p>\n<p>更稳健的是<strong>连续变化检测与分类（CCDC）</strong>：它对每个像元的时间序列拟合含线性趋势与谐波项的分段模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ρ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\rho}(t) = a_0 + a_1 t + \\sum_k (b_k \\cos 2\\pi k \\omega t + c_k \\sin 2\\pi k \\omega t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 为年周期频率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为谐波阶数）。当新观测连续偏离预测超阈值时判定突变并重拟合——季节性波动被模型吸收，只有结构性变化才触发。CCDC 对 EUDR 的价值是能<strong>回推变化的准确日期</strong>，判断变化发生在基准时点之前（合规）还是之后（不合规）。</p>\n<p>RADD 走雷达侧的同构思路：对 Sentinel-1 后向散射时序做统计突变检测识别森林结构损失，<strong>告警延迟以天计</strong>且不受云影响；缺点同样需结合地形与降雨降噪。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双时相 NDVI</td>\n<td>S2</td>\n<td>变化掩膜</td>\n<td>云假阳性、季节性噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NBR 指数</td>\n<td>S2（SWIR）</td>\n<td>火烧/砍伐边界</td>\n<td>仍需无云影像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCDC</td>\n<td>S2 全时序</td>\n<td>变化日期 + 类型</td>\n<td>建需长时序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RADD</td>\n<td>S1</td>\n<td>近实时告警点</td>\n<td>需地形/湿度降噪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖判定-4-公顷地块与-10-米像元的几何错配\">覆盖判定：4 公顷地块与 10 米像元的几何错配</h2><p>一个数值硬约束必须讲清楚：EUDR 允许 4 公顷以下地块用单点坐标申报，而 Sentinel-2 的像元是 10 米见方，单像元地面面积约</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>pixel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{pixel}} = 10\\ \\mathrm{m} \\times 10\\ \\mathrm{m} = 100\\ \\mathrm{m}^2 = 0.01\\ \\mathrm{ha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pixel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ha</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即一个 10 米像元仅覆盖 0.01 公顷，覆盖 4 公顷理论上需 400 个像元；换成 30 米的 Landsat，单像元 0.09 公顷，只需约 45 个像元。含义是：<strong>地块越小，可用的遥感证据越稀薄</strong>。一个 0.5 公顷的小农咖啡地块在 10 米影像上只有约 50 个像元，任一云像元或混合像元都会显著影响面积估计。\n更棘手的是<strong>混合像元（mixed pixel）</strong>：地块边界很少恰好落在像元网格上，边缘像元同时包含森林与非森林地表，观测反射率是两者按面积加权的混合值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext>forest</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext>nonforest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{\\text{obs}} = f \\cdot \\rho_{\\text{forest}} + (1-f) \\cdot \\rho_{\\text{nonforest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">forest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">nonforest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0 或 1 时判定可靠，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f \\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 时极易翻转。对小于若干像元的地块，应显式声明&quot;面积估计不确定度&quot;而非给出精确的毁林公顷数。</p>\n<p>面积归属的正确做法是把地块多边形与变化像元栅格做<strong>叠加分析</strong>：变化像元中心落在多边形内才计入，或用像元-多边形相交面积按比例归属。前者简单但系统性偏低（边缘像元被丢弃），后者精确但需投影到等面积坐标系（如 Albers）以免高纬度面积被压缩。这一步必须与<a href=\"parcel-geolocation-data-model\">地块数据模型</a>的几何自洽——若坐标精度不足 6 位小数，叠加分析本身建立在模糊边界上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与官方底图和告警层的交叉核验\">与官方底图和告警层的交叉核验</h2><p>自建管线算出的结果不能自说自话。欧盟森林观测台（EUFO）由欧盟委员会与联合研究中心（JRC）维护，汇集哥白尼计划及其他公私数据源，提供森林覆盖变化及其驱动因素的公开地图与数据集（来源：欧盟委员会 EUDR 官方页面，2026 年）。企业平台应把它当<strong>参考层做交叉核验</strong>：若自建管线判&quot;无变化&quot;而 EUFO 参考层显示该地块落在近期森林损失图斑内，这个分歧必须被解释清楚，否则提交的申报会被质疑。常引用的公开层包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据产品</th>\n<th>维护方</th>\n<th>关键特征</th>\n<th>在 EUDR 中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Global Forest Change</td>\n<td>马里兰大学（Hansen 等）</td>\n<td>30 m、2001 年起年度树冠损失</td>\n<td>历史背景核查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GLAD 告警</td>\n<td>马里兰大学 GLAD 实验室</td>\n<td>光学近实时（周级）、30 m</td>\n<td>光学告警补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RADD 告警</td>\n<td>瓦赫宁根大学 + GFW</td>\n<td>雷达近实时、10 m</td>\n<td>云区兜底告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JRC 全球森林覆盖图</td>\n<td>欧盟联合研究中心</td>\n<td>官方森林定义基准</td>\n<td>森林定义口径源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EUFO 参考层</td>\n<td>欧盟委员会 / JRC</td>\n<td>官方统一底图</td>\n<td>监管交叉核验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个易被忽略的口径问题是**&quot;森林&quot;的定义**。EUDR 采用 FAO 式定义（树高、冠层覆盖、最小面积阈值的组合），而各遥感产品各有判定标准，同一片地在 A 产品里是森林、在 B 产品里可能只是&quot;其他林地&quot;。因此交叉核验必须<strong>固定口径基准</strong>（通常取 JRC/FAO 定义）并在证据包里显式记录，否则层间差异会被误读成&quot;毁林&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地与证据留存\">工程落地与证据留存</h2><p>可运维的服务不是脚本，而是带状态的四段式流水线：<strong>索引 → 预处理 → 检测 → 证据归档</strong>。索引段对 Sentinel 目录（如 Copernicus Data Space）做空间-时间查询，按地块包围盒取交集再按云量过滤；预处理段做云掩膜（S2 场景分类层 SCL）与大气校正；检测段调用前述算子输出变化图斑；归档段把地块 ID、影像场景 ID、算法版本、参数阈值、变化日期与变化面积打包成<strong>不可变证据记录</strong>。易踩的决策点：20 m SWIR 上采样到 10 m 算 NBR 时，最近邻与双线性会影响边界像元，须固定并记录；基准期不能只取 2020-12-31 单日（那天多云怎么办），实践取前后数月中值合成并把窗口写进元数据。</p>\n<p>证据留存还涉及数据治理：影像本身是公开数据，但<strong>地块坐标与供应商的绑定关系</strong>属商业敏感信息，须按最小必要原则存留并明确保留期限，不应无差别地长期囤积原始坐标。这与 EUDR 申报系统对 DDS 参考号的留存要求相呼应——判定记录要能追溯到具体申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EUDR 的卫星比对不是&quot;看图判断&quot;，而是<strong>基准时点锚定、可复现、可核验</strong>的三段式判定：基准影像 → 变化检测 → 面积归属。</li>\n<li><strong>Sentinel-2 光学提供精细边界（10 m、约 5 天重访），Sentinel-1 雷达提供云区兜底告警</strong>，两者必须并行，单靠光学在热带会缺窗。</li>\n<li>变化检测从双时相 NDVI 起步，要抗季节性噪声与云污染，<strong>CCDC 类时序模型</strong>能给出变化日期，对判断&quot;是否在 2020-12-31 之后&quot;至关重要。</li>\n<li><strong>10 米像元 = 0.01 公顷</strong>，小地块可遥感证据稀薄，混合像元会让边界判定翻转，必须量化不确定度。</li>\n<li>自建管线要与 <strong>EUFO / JRC 官方底图</strong>交叉核验，并固定&quot;森林&quot;定义口径，否则分歧无法解释。</li>\n<li>产出应是<strong>不可变证据记录</strong>（场景 ID + 算法版本 + 参数 + 变化日期），这是应对抽查的唯一自卫手段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卫星影像比对与毁林变化监测数据管线","id":"卫星影像比对与毁林变化监测数据管线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：什么叫\"可复现的毁林比对\"","id":"核心概念-什么叫-可复现的毁林比对"},{"level":2,"text":"影像源选型：光学与雷达的互补","id":"影像源选型-光学与雷达的互补"},{"level":2,"text":"变化检测算子：从 NDVI 时序到 CCDC","id":"变化检测算子-从-ndvi-时序到-ccdc"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖判定：4 公顷地块与 10 米像元的几何错配","id":"覆盖判定-4-公顷地块与-10-米像元的几何错配"},{"level":2,"text":"与官方底图和告警层的交叉核验","id":"与官方底图和告警层的交叉核验"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地与证据留存","id":"工程落地与证据留存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地块溯源与批次谱系建模：从原料到成品的供应链图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/parcel-geolocation-traceability-data/plot-traceability-batch-lineage"},"next":{"title":"DDS 尽职调查声明数据模型与字段结构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eudr-deforestation-free-supply-chain-due-diligence/due-diligence-statement-submission-system/dds-statement-data-model"}}